        <mxCell id="noteBody" value="· the scroll model moves from a hand-written hook to the registry primitive — the same swap A1 landed on the chief drawer&#10;· the scroll axis flips: column-reverse (scrollTop 0 = newest) → normal scroller (0 = oldest, scrollHeight = newest)&#10;· rows gain real ids: mapTranscript projects m.id onto user / robot / thinking / note / review rows (view-side only, wire untouched)&#10;· useChatFollow and its unit test retire (the detail column was their last consumer)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
